WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.790
Dream...

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.380
The day the dream ends...

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:07.680
Like the snow melting in the spring sunshine and disappearing...

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:11.970
Like the way memories fade away into eternity...

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.980
Now, the long dream has come to an end...

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.770
Just one last one... My wish is...

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:51.260
The skies of the twilight with no time
toki no nai tasogare sora

