00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:05.120
I'm taking a trip to eternity
eien no tabi wo shiteru

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:19.330
I continued the search on the cold tip of the finger
tsumetai yubisaki sagashi tsuzuketeta

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:24.700
It's burning from the fragments
kakera kara yaiteru

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:31.160
Hugging deep in my heart
tsuyoku mune ni dakishimete

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:38.240
The lost item that I was searching for
sagashiteita nakushimono

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:43.710
Checking for it in both of my hands
ryoute no naka tashikamete

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:57.090
The time that meets the new morning
atarashii asa ni deau toki ga ugakidasuyo

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.640
<b>The Trace of the Dream</b>

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:16.790
Welcome back!

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.840
Mom said that she'll return from work late, and we should go ahead and eat.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.920
Yuu... ichi...?

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:28.390
Yuuichi...

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.850
I made some curry, but do you want to eat some?

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:33.970
Nope. I don't want any.

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:36.600
It isn't good for your body if you don't eat.

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:40.190
The final exams are coming soon, so you have to take care of your health...

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.480
SHUT UP!!!!!!

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.070
I already told you I don't want any!!!

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.110
I'm sorry...

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:50.530
Just let me know whenever you want to eat.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.370
DAMMIT!

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:19.560
Ayu?

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.610
Yuuichi-kun, you're late!

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.400
Ayu!

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:25.070
Yuuichi-kun!

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.320
AYUUUUUU!!!!!!!

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:31.620
Why...?

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:36.160
Why did I forget about this until now...?

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:39.250
About this important thing... Why...?

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.000
Damn it...

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.670
Morning! It's morning!

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:52.080
I'm going to the forest.

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:02.270
This tree seems to have been chopped down seven years ago.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.310
Nayuki...?

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:10.070
It was a big tree that could be seen from anywhere in town.

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:12.070
What's wrong...?

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.120
I just remembered...

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.290
About a girl who feel from this tree seven years ago...

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:24.130
She was a girl I got to know here, and she always had a lonely look in her eyes...

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.290
Look, Yuuichi-kun!

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.340
What a beautiful sunset.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.970
Tomorrow, and the day after that...

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:36.510
It would be good to see the setting sun with Yuuichi-kun forever.

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:40.480
During the next break, I'll come visit Ayu's place again!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.770
I promise!

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.360
Yuuichi-kun.

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:49.230
I still have 2 wishes left, right?

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.400
Yeah.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:53.200
Then, my second wish.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:56.830
I want to attend the same school as Yuuichi-kun...

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:57.780
Ayu...

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.910
I want to attend the same school as Yuuichi-kun,

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:04.420
and study together, eat lunch at school together,

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:06.590
and clean up together, and also...

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:09.130
I want to go home with Yuuichi-kun together...

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.260
Is this wish acceptable?

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:13.260
I got it!

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:16.470
Then from today, this place will be the "school" just for the two of us.

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.970
There are no teachers. There are no annoying tests or homework.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:23.560
You can also take a break when you feel like it, and you can play when you want to.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.690
That's great! Then how about the school lunch?

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.730
You can eat whatever you like!

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:29.070
Then, taiyaki!

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:30.940
You're telling me that you're gonna have taiyaki everyday?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:31.650
Yeah!

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:32.780
Oh well.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:34.910
Since it's the "school" just for the two of us anyway.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:35.450
Yeah!

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:38.280
Let's meet again at the "school" tomorrow.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:39.240
Yeah...

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:42.910
Promise...

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:46.750
From that day on, we began to meet each other in this forest...

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:50.250
Everyday we played until the sun set...

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:57.970
You're late, Ayu.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.560
I'm sorry, Yuuichi-kun.

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.980
I was looking for this.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:06.770
A glass jar?

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:10.360
Hey, Yuuichi-kun, let's use this to make a time capsule!

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.030
Time capsule?

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:16.150
We're going to put our memories in this and bury it!

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.530
You, that's...!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.790
I still have one more wish, but that's okay.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:24.830
Since I have plenty of happiness right now.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.250
The one that's left is for me to use in the future.

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:32.210
Maybe I won't be the one who will use it, and I'll give it to another person instead.

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:35.880
Will it be found even though there aren't any markings?

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:36.970
It will be found!

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.760
If there's someone who really needs this doll from his or her heart.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.480
Yuuichi... kun...

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:50.900
Don't talk!

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:52.480
I'll take you to the hospital right now...!

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:56.070
I'm sorry...

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.030
I fell off...

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:00.200
I was supposed to be good at climbing trees...

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:01.620
Ayu...

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:04.660
Don't make a face like that...

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:08.290
I'm alright... It doesn't hurt at all...

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.500
Hey! Don't give up!

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:12.170
I bought...

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:15.050
...this for you!

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:19.260
F-For me...?

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:20.430
Yeah.

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:22.300
If you don't need it, I'm going to throw it away...!

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.260
Thank you, Yuuichi-kun...

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:27.310
Next time we see each other, I'll definitely wear this.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:27.980
Yeah...

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.060
Will you play with me again?

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:31.100
Yeah...

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:32.940
Then pinky promise...

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:37.570
Here, we did a pinky promise.

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:39.110
It's a promise...

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:41.410
We've promised that we're going to play again...

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.410
Thank you...

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.200
Yuuichi...

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:46.870
kun...

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:52.130
Hey... it's a joke...

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.590
You're kidding...

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:54.630
Ayu.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:55.960
Ayu!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:58.300
AYUUUUUUU!!!!!!

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:05.970
That was Ayu-chan...

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:11.440
That time capsule was only supposed to be filled with fun memories...

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.650
If something like that didn't happen...

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:16.610
I'm a coward...

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.360
I was trying to forget...

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:20.200
I was trying to forget all about it...!

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.780
About the fact that Ayu was no longer in this world...!

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:26.740
She was even looking for that doll the entire time...!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:30.040
Yuuichi, let's try to find it.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:36.090
Ayu-chan was looking for that angel doll, right?

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:40.260
Then, let's use our hands and find it for her.

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:42.970
The doll...?

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:44.050
Yeah.

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:48.770
It's alright. Yuuichi, you can definitely find it.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.310
Yeah... okay, let's find it!

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:54.400
What!? You're looking for something!?

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.020
I need some helpers!

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.900
It's better to have more people than just myself.

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:02.450
What the heck are you talking about, it's just before the final exams?

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.610
You're not even studying.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.490
It's alright, I don't mind helping.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:07.780
Kaori!

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:10.450
It's "We help each other when someone's in trouble".

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.460
Thanks, Kaori.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.290
Can't help it...

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.580
Fine! You want me to help, right?

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.750
Kitagawa, thanks!

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:25.430
Hey, are you sure you buried it here?

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:26.260
Yeah.

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:28.850
You didn't leave any markings?

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:32.350
I'm sure that I buried it near a big tree...

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.020
Then...

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.600
It's the same as not having any markings.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:56.170
It's alright! It'll be found!

00:09:56.500 --> 00:10:00.800
If there's someone who really needs this doll from his or her heart.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.940
Hey, Aizawa! Isn't this it!?

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:20.360
What!? You found it!?

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:22.280
Yeah, it's this.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:23.780
I wonder... but isn't it?

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:33.870
I found it...

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:39.130
That's good, Aizawa-kun.

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.920
A jumbo serving of cafeteria curry.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:46.590
And if you take my next cleaning duty and help me with the report also, I'll call it even.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.300
Yeah, I got it. I'll promise.

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.310
Then, we'll head back home.

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:55.730
Nope, I have to stop by the hospital before I go home.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:57.940
Sheesh, you're anti-social.

00:10:57.980 --> 00:10:59.350
See you, Nayuki.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.770
Thank you, Kaori, Kitagawa-kun.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:06.440
Yuuichi, let's hurry home.

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:07.400
Y... Yeah...

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.710
It's all dirty.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.420
Yeah, since it was in the ground for seven years.

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:28.720
Shall I fix it for you?

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:30.590
Can you do it?

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:33.260
Yeah, I think I can do it somehow.

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:34.390
Then, please.

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:38.100
Hey, can I ask you for a favor in exchange?

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:39.520
Okay.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:42.650
The item Ayu was searching for has finally been found...

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.780
It doesn't mean that Ayu will come back...

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:51.950
But I feel that I can reflect back on that incident that happened seven years ago...

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:57.500
Yes, this is the Minase residence.

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:59.410
Oh, Mom!

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:03.250
The job ran late, so I've only just arrived at the station.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:05.250
Is there anything that you would like to eat?

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:09.760
Right now, Yuuichi's just about to cook.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:13.340
What? He asked me to do something else.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:15.850
I don't need anything so just come back soon.

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:17.680
Okay, okay. See you.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.000
Don't worry Nayuki. I'll get it.

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.500
Yes, this is the Minase residence.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:45.210
Yes, it is.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:48.710
Hold on a second! Where!?

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:50.510
Yes, yes...

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.880
I understand... thank you very much...

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:54.390
What is it?

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:57.180
Akiko-san was involved in an accident...

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:11.040
Operation in Progress

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.150
Operation in Progress

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:22.870
Mom... Mom!!!

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:24.700
She needs her rest. Please be quiet.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.960
Are you her family members?

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
She's in critical condition.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.670
The next two to three days will be pivotal.

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:35.210
It can't be...

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:38.130
Even if we are able to save her life,

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:41.050
we don't know if she'll regain consciousness or not...

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:45.350
At any rate, please contact your relatives as soon as possible.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.480
I just called my mom.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:54.360
It seems that the airport is closed because of the bad weather,

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.780
so they don't know when the planes will be able to fly again.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.910
Gosh, this is troublesome... being away at a time like this.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:05.870
There's no need to worry, Akiko-san will be alright for sure.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.790
We were always together...

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:17.300
I wasn't lonely, even though I didn't know my father's face, because I had my mom's kind smile...

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:23.100
I was able to always laugh and work hard because my mom was here...

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:25.720
With schoolwork, and with housework...

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:29.560
But I'm all alone now...

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:31.020
What are you talking about!?

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:33.150
Akiko-san isn't dead!

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.360
She won't go and leave you alone!

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:38.530
I'm also with you, so...

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:41.570
How can you say that...?

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:42.740
Nayuki...

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:48.290
Yuuichi, are you going to make a miracle and save my mom?

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.670
It's impossible... right...?

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:58.380
You cheered me up before...

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:05.430
You said "For Ayu, let's find the angel doll", and you encouraged me.

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:07.520
What happened to that smile you had!?

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:10.140
I can't do it...

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:14.560
I can't laugh anymore...

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.070
I'm so bad...!

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:25.490
Even while I was cheering Yuuichi on in the forest, I was relieved inside my heart,

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:28.910
since I knew Ayu-chan was gone.

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:34.920
Because Ayu-chan was the only thing in Yuuichi's eyes the entire time!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:39.760
"For Ayu-chan, let's find the angel doll." That was a lie.

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:47.560
Actually, I just didn't want to see Yuuichi being depressed forever about Ayu-chan...

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:49.220
Nayuki...

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:51.810
I can't laugh anymore...

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:54.100
I can't be strong anymore...

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:59.570
If my mom is gone, I'm all alone...

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:07.620
I didn't notice them all this time... Nayuki's feelings...

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:10.910
Maybe even that time seven years ago...

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:17.540
I finally found you!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:19.500
Nayuki...

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:22.220
I was looking for you the whole time.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:24.720
I had something I wanted to give you.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.970
This, it's called a snow bunny.

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:34.770
I'm not good at it so it took me some time, but I tried my best.

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.810
You'll come see me again, right?

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:42.610
I couldn't say it the whole time, but, Yuuichi, I...

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:43.860
Shut up!

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:56.370
Now we're done!!!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:00.750
Does that mean that I've been trampling on Nayuki's feelings the entire time...?

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.050
Aizawa-kun...

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:06.510
I heard about the accident. Is everything alright?

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:10.390
Yeah, they are supposed to contact us if anything changes.

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:13.770
Not about that, but about Nayuki.

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:15.520
Is it alright to leave her alone?

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:16.890
Yeah.

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:21.520
Actually, I've known about Aizawa-kun for a long time now.

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:24.530
Since Nayuki was always cheerfully talking about you.

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:25.570
I see.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:29.740
"It's hard to tell since Yuuichi is shy, but he's a nice guy."

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:33.740
"Even though I haven't seen him for many years, I don't think he's changed," she said.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:37.830
Really, she said it to me so many times.

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.290
I see.

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:46.340
Nayuki was looking at you the whole time, even before you came to this town again.

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:53.010
Aizawa-kun.

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:55.220
What is it?

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:57.560
Please protect Nayuki.

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:04.280
I'm home.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:13.950
This doll is a doll that can grant you any kind of wish.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.460
"It can grant you any kind of wish" ...huh...

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:24.170
Ayu...

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:25.590
I...

